# Citation metadata: GitHub shows a "Cite this repository" button from it, and Zenodo reads it when it archives a
# release (title, authors, license). The authors are the creators Zenodo listed from the GitHub contributors until
# v0.14.1, WikidataIntegrator's included: add the new contributors here, Zenodo no longer lists them by itself.
